Modifications
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This directory is a vendored copy of the upstream project at commit

    2d68168863dd8e78f883b752f420dc46aa2d7108

taken from the fork pallakartheekreddy/paradym-wallet, branch v1.0.3.

Files in this directory were modified for the Sunbird RC Age Verification
showcase between 3 and 27 August 2026 — 72 files, 1956 insertions, 427
deletions, in seven commits by two authors. The modified files are enumerated in
SUNBIRD-CHANGES.md.

The changes themselves are visible as this repository's own history rather than
as a patch set:

    git log -p -- vendor/paradym-wallet

The first commit under that path carries the unmodified upstream tree and is
attributed to no one but Animo Solutions; every commit after it is a
modification, with its original author and date preserved.

All modifications are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, on the same
terms as the original work. No part of this directory has been relicensed.

